OL,3,GNEWSASouth West drought blamed on water
OL,4,Afirm's 'neglect'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has accused South West
OL,7,FWater of helping create the conditions
OL,8,Fbehind a severe drought declaration
OL,9,Faffecting parts of Devon and the wider
OL,10,FSouth West.
OL,12,FDevon County Council leader Julian
OL,13,FBrazil said the drought had been
OL,14,F"decades in the making" and the firm's
OL,15,F"neglect" had "put us here".
OL,17,FHe said the company had "not built the
OL,18,Freservoirs Devon's people and
OL,19,Fbusinesses deserved".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
