OL,3,GNEWSASouth West drought blamed on water
OL,4,Afirm's 'neglect'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water said: "We are doing
OL,7,Feverything we can to manage resources,
OL,8,Fstrengthen our network and fix leaks,
OL,9,Fand we need customers and local
OL,10,Fbusinesses to help reduce water use
OL,11,Fwherever possible to protect supplies
OL,12,Funtil rivers and reservoirs can
OL,13,Frecover."
